# See https://github.com/orgs/community/discussions/23064#discussioncomment-8383923
# Keep these AFTER the rules above: the last matching pattern wins.

# JavaScript / TypeScript
**/package.json
**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/yarn.lock

# Python
**/pyproject.toml
**/requirements*.txt
**/uv.lock
**/poetry.lock

# C#
**/*.csproj
**/Directory.Packages.props
**/packages.lock.json

# Go
**/go.mod
**/go.sum

# Java
**/pom.xml
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.properties

# Rust
**/Cargo.toml
**/Cargo.lock

# PHP
**/composer.json
**/composer.lock
